  "arrangerNotes": "Verse 1, vocal line, verified against the Mutopia LilyPond score; the score's rest is kept. 'Mingled' is an eighth-note triplet (each note 1/3 beat). Slurred notes carry one syllable over two notes. Simplifications (2 chromatic notes, F major): the F♯ in 'cold and strange' is played as 1 (F), and the B♮ on 'one' is played as 4 (B♭). Range low 5 to 6. C and D arrangements use identical degree sequences (both fit their drums).",
